how to protect your recipe so I got a  great question from one of my YouTube  viewers I love you guys amazing me who  wrote in to say thanks so much for the  advice I have a seasoning what would be  the best way to protect the recipe and  start making money from it I don't want  to approach a company without protecting  my product please any advice I would  appreciate it thank you  so here's the thing okay you can't  really get a patent or copyright on a  recipe if you were inventing a new way  of cooking then you might be able to  patent it but again remember patent only  lasts for 20 years with recipes it's  typically a trade secret so if you look  at the the recipe fer for KFC Colonel  Sanders secret chicken recipe not many  people know that if you look at the the  coca-cola company right they've been  around for over a hundred years and not  many people know exactly how coca-cola  is made what those companies will do is  make people sign a nondisclosure  agreement so basically by you opening up  and telling somebody exactly how your  seasoning is made they have to sign a  nondisclosure agreement saying that they  won't share with anybody else that's the  best way to protect your recipe now will  a company sign that who knows if you're  trying to sell it to a big company  typically they don't like signing these  things I remember when I was in the  venture capital business and even now  when entrepreneurs are pushing with  their ideas I don't sign non-disclosure  agreements because I see too many deals  and there's too many people doing almost  the exact same thing you definitely want  to put it on for team members that you  bring on board so if you're bringing on  people to help you make this you don't  want them going and running with it to  start their own business to start their  own seasoning recipe right taking your  exact same one so you want them signing  on disclosure agreements and you can try  you could try with companies you could  travel suppliers you could try with  other people who you're trying to sell  us into but it's a hard sell for them  it's hard for them to want to say yes  I'll sign the non-disclosure agreement  you have to have something that makes  them say wow you know they tried your  your recipe you  seasoning like oh my god we need to have  this we need to sign the deal is the  best thing we've ever tried then they  might be willing to sign the  non-disclosure agreement but that really  is the best way to protect your idea is  to a non-disclosure agreement because  you can't patent or copyright a recipe  believe for those are watching like the  video thumbs up below leave a comment  let me know what you think ask me a  question below if you have thoughts in  this video leave it below and click on  my face to subscribe to the channel and  see more videos like this thank you guys  so much I'll see you soon
 

